  "english": "Wednesday. Patristic Hymn [Harts] of Repentance.\nMidday Psalm 85 [86]:2 \"Preserve [thy] servant.\"\nEpistle: 1 Corinthians 15:20 \"But now Christ...\" to verse 32 \"...evil words.\"\nAlleluia: according to the tone.\nHenceforth, look up and sing the Alleluia of the Wednesday and Friday Gospel according to the tone.\nGospel: Mark 3:6 \"And going out...\" to verse 12 \"...they should make him [known].\"\n\nTone 1 [Ay]:\nThursday. Patristic Hymn [Harts] of Repentance.\nMidday Psalm 98 [99]:5 \"Exalt ye.\"\nEpistle: 1 Corinthians 15:34 \"But you, brethren...\" to verse 49 \"...of the heavenly.\"\nAlleluia: \"Exalt ye.\"\nGospel: Mark 3:20 \"They come into a house...\" to verse 30 \"...is in him.\"\n\nFriday. Patristic Hymn [Harts] of Rest.\nMidday Psalm 97 [98]:3 \"They have seen.\"\nEpistle: 1 Corinthians 15:50 \"But this I say...\" to verse 57 \"...Jesus Christ.\"\nAlleluia: according to the tone.\nGospel: Mark 3:31 \"The brethren come...\" to verse 35 [Note: text says 3:31 to 3:35 / 4:8] \"...one a hundred.\"\n\n\"...blessed.\" Hymn [Yerg]: \"Holiness becometh thy house.\"\nLitany [Karoz]: \"Let us say.\"\n\"Holy God,\" who wast crucified.\nProcessional [Mankunk] Tone 3 [Gk]: \"The Only-Begotten descended from the Father.\"\nAfter the Processional [Mankunk] Litany: \"By this holy church.\" \"Save [us].\"\nPrayer: \"At the door of this holy temple.\"\n\nAt the Midday Liturgy, Introit: \"Our Lord and Savior Jesus Christ.\"\nAntiphon: \"The Lord reigneth with majesty.\"\nPatristic Hymn [Sharakan] Tone 3 [G3]: \"Who established by the Word.\"\nPsalm 47 [48]:8 \"God established the foundations.\"\nProverbs 3:19 \"God by wisdom...\" to verse 26 \"...shall not be shaken.\"\nProphet Ezekiel 40:3 \"And he took me...\" to verse 10 \"...here and there.\"\nCatholic [Epistle] 1 Peter 2:1 \"Putting away...\" to verse 10 \"...you have obtained mercy.\"\nAlleluia: \"His foundations are upon the mountain.\"\nGospel: Matthew 16:13 \"And Jesus going...\" to verse 19 \"...loosed in heaven.\"\nHagiology: \"The Angelic.\"\n\nIn the Evening: \"Bow down [thy ear]\" and \"Live.\" \"Gladsome Light.\"\nMessiah [Mesedi]: \"Bless the Lord here.\"\nLitany [Karoz]: \"Let us say.\"\n\"Holy God,\" who wast crucified.\nAnd the priests shall vest together and come with the cross, the gospel, incense, and candles to the chancel, and they shall begin:\nHymn of Ascent [Hambartsi] Tone 8 [Dz]: \"Today the saints gathered together,\" sing both together.\nAnd after \"Compassionate Father,\" they shall begin to perform the Pre-festal Office [Naxatonak].\nPatristic Hymn [Harts] Tone 8 [Dz]: \"Who the first mother...\" with its proper canons.\nAnd at the conclusion, Litany: \"The Holy Mother of God.\" \"Save [us].\"\nPrayer: \"Receive, Lord, [our] prayers.\"\n\"Our Father who art in heaven.\"\n\nCanon of Holy Shoghakat,\nThat is, of Holy Etchmiadzin.\n\nSaturday. Feast of Shoghakat of Holy Etchmiadzin, according to the vision of our holy Gregory the Enlightener.\nTone 3 [Ah]: \"Rejoice, O Holy Church,\" with its proper canons.\nMagnificat [Metsatsustse]: \"Rejoice, O blessed Mother of God.\"",
